>>
endobj
234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (The controller learns the MAC address and switch port of devices when packets arrive. If the destination is unknown, the packet is flooded. When the destination is known, the controller installs a forwarding rule so later packets can be sent to the correct port.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
